{"sid": "s27", "voice": "male", "total_duration": 72.1, "segments": [{"para": 0, "start": 0.0, "duration": 1.96, "text": "高上玉皇心印妙经"}, {"para": 1, "start": 1.96, "duration": 2.53, "text": "上药三品，神与气精。"}, {"para": 2, "start": 4.49, "duration": 2.61, "text": "恍恍惚惚，杳杳冥冥。"}, {"para": 3, "start": 7.11, "duration": 2.06, "text": "存无守有，顷刻而成。"}, {"para": 4, "start": 9.17, "duration": 2.53, "text": "回风混合，百日功灵。"}, {"para": 5, "start": 11.7, "duration": 2.53, "text": "默朝上帝，一纪飞升。"}, {"para": 6, "start": 14.24, "duration": 2.48, "text": "知者易悟，昧者难行。"}, {"para": 7, "start": 16.72, "duration": 2.53, "text": "履踐天光，呼吸育清。"}, {"para": 8, "start": 19.25, "duration": 2.72, "text": "出玄入牝，若亡若存。"}, {"para": 9, "start": 21.97, "duration": 3.97, "text": "绵绵不绝，固蒂根深。"}, {"para": 10, "start": 25.94, "duration": 2.53, "text": "人各有精，精合其神。"}, {"para": 11, "start": 28.47, "duration": 2.48, "text": "神合其气，气合其真。"}, {"para": 12, "start": 30.95, "duration": 2.85, "text": "不得其真，皆是强名。"}, {"para": 13, "start": 33.8, "duration": 2.77, "text": "神能入石，神能飞形。"}, {"para": 14, "start": 36.57, "duration": 2.48, "text": "入水不溺，入火不焚。"}, {"para": 15, "start": 39.05, "duration": 2.53, "text": "神依形生，精依气盈。"}, {"para": 16, "start": 41.59, "duration": 2.61, "text": "不凋不残，松柏青青。"}, {"para": 17, "start": 44.2, "duration": 2.19, "text": "三品一理，妙不可听。"}, {"para": 18, "start": 46.39, "duration": 2.72, "text": "其聚则有，其散则零。"}, {"para": 19, "start": 49.11, "duration": 2.3, "text": "七窍相通，窍窍光明。"}, {"para": 20, "start": 51.41, "duration": 2.3, "text": "圣日圣月，照耀金庭。"}, {"para": 21, "start": 53.71, "duration": 2.43, "text": "一得永得，自然身轻。"}, {"para": 22, "start": 56.14, "duration": 2.61, "text": "太和充溢，骨散寒琼。"}, {"para": 23, "start": 58.75, "duration": 3.21, "text": "得丹则灵，不得则倾。"}, {"para": 24, "start": 61.96, "duration": 2.95, "text": "丹在心中，非白非青。"}, {"para": 25, "start": 64.91, "duration": 2.98, "text": "诵之万遍，妙理自明。"}, {"para": 26, "start": 67.89, "duration": 4.21, "text": "高上玉皇心印妙经卷终"}]}